{"study_accession":"PRJNA1238189","secondary_study_accession":"SRP571514","title":"RNAseq analysis of human neutrophils from healthy controls, people with frailty and people with rheumatoid arthritis","description":"We report gene expression profiles of blood neutrophils from (1) people with frailty (2) healthy older people (>60Y), (3) healthy younger people (18-25Y), (4) people with rheumatoid arthritis. Overall design: Neutrophils (purity >97%) were isolated from peripheral blood by separation of leukocytes from erythrocytes using HetaSep, then centrifugation through density-gradient reagent (HetaSep). Remaining erythrocytes were removed by hypotonic lysis using ammonium chloride buffer. RNA was isolated using Trizol:chloroform, cleaned up by Qiagen RNeasy kit including on-column DNase digest and sequenced on the DNBseq platform.","pubmed":"41906686","geo_series":"","n_samples":39,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN47462002","study_accession":"PRJNA1238189","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"Blood neutrophil, 0h, Rheumatoid arthritis, replicate 10","description":"Blood neutrophil, 0h, Rheumatoid arthritis, replicate 10","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM8856911","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2026-03-22","attributes":[["source_name","Neutrophil"],["cell_type","Neutrophil"],["group","Rheumatoid arthritis"],["treatment","0h no treatment"],["geo_loc_name","missing"],["collection_date","missing"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR32768004","experiment_accession":"SRX28052777","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"DNBSEQ-G400","read_count":48192292,"base_count":9638458400,"first_public":"2026-03-22","experiment_title":"DNBSEQ-G400 sequencing: GSM8856911: Blood neutrophil, 0h, Rheumatoid arthritis, replicate 10 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMN47462003","study_accession":"PRJNA1238189","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"Blood neutrophil, 0h, Rheuma